{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 24, :comments ["<b>And bruised and crushed.</b> After speaking of blemishes that occur naturally, whose relevance concerns consecrated things alone — that it is forbidden to offer blemished animals on the altar and to inflict a blemish upon them after their consecration — he now speaks of artificially inflicted blemishes, which it is forbidden to inflict even upon unconsecrated animals."], :book :leviticus, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 22, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:37:20.188460527Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}